' Source: 04_Development/Backend/src/main/java/com/sfms/
' Each class = actual JPA @Entity. All entities extend BaseEntity
' (UUID id, createdAt, updatedAt, createdBy, updatedBy).
' Inheritance arrows hidden to keep layout clean — noted below.
' Cross-module communication via UUID only — no cross-module
