' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
' DESIGN NOTES
' ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
note as N1
  **Common Architecture:**
  All entities extend BaseEntity
  (UUID id, createdAt, updatedAt,
  createdBy, updatedBy).
  Business code (D1): "code" field
  is the public ID in JSON responses;
  UUID is the internal PK.
  Cross-module refs use UUID only
  — no cross-module entity imports
  (AP-AI-005).
end note

note as N2
  **Append-Only Entities (no UPDATE/DELETE):**
  AuditLog — hash chain for tamper-proof log
  HealthHistoryEvent — student health trail
  IncidentEvent — incident audit log
  ServingDish — frozen at meal handover time
end note

note as N3
  **Key Cross-Module UUID References:**
  Menu.partnerId → Partner (MF04)
  StudentDistribution.studentId → Student (MF03)
  InventoryBatch.ingredientId → CatalogIngredient (MF05)
  IncidentAffectedStudent.studentId → Student (MF03)
  CorrectiveAction.inspectionId → InspectionSession (MF07)
  FoodSample.dishId → Dish (MF05)
end note

@enduml
